r  jail and so right now we're number four  in crime we've got metro joe lombardo  sparks reno and then us as is where the  crime is i went on the strip the other  day it smelled like everybody smoked  marijuana it just felt so dangerous i  thought i might need to get a ccw if i'm  getting gas and some of these goofy  people are coming out the strip and i  need to protect my family so that's why  i was going to ccw  thank you mr lee and to clarify you  mentioned you spoke privately with the  instructor but again to clarify 15  seconds did you find that offensive yeah  i did and that's why i went up it's like  when people take a picture with me and  they have a beer in their hand it puts  me in a position i don't want to be in  that gentleman heard for me but he  didn't have to hear me tell you how bad  he was i had already told him that i'm  not in for destroying people who are  running businesses i want to make sure  they're successful but they learn they  need to stop doing if they want to be  successful thank you denise has the next  question

